## 📁 Repository Structure
```text
Advanced Econometrics Project Geopolitics Of Oil/
│
├── R/                              # R Scripts
│   ├── analysis.r                  # Main econometric modeling and tests (Pooled OLS, FE, RE, Hausman)
│   └── merge and arima forecast.r  # Data merging, cleaning, and ARIMA forecasting
│
├── variables/                      # Raw data files
│   ├── DCOILBRENTEU.csv            # Brent Oil Prices (FRED)
│   ├── VIXCLS.csv                  # VIX Volatility Index (FRED)
│   ├── ECBMLFR.csv                 # ECB Policy Rates
│   ├── neer.csv                    # Nominal Effective Exchange Rates (IMF IFS)
│   ├── ipi.csv                     # Industrial Production Index (IMF IFS)
│   ├── OECD_CPI_DE_FR_IT.csv       # CPI Data (OECD)
│   └── links.txt                   # Data source documentation
│
├── panel_data_econometrics.csv     # FINAL cleaned and engineered panel dataset (N=126)
├── Geopolitics_of_Oil_2026_Gulf_Crisis_Report.pdf # Final Research Paper
├── README.md                       # Project documentation
└── .gitignore                      # Ignored files (outputs, R history, etc.)